#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:73
msgid "One Christmas, two skies"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:73
msgid "Um Natal, dois céus"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:78
msgid ""
"In Brazil the light stays late and the evening arrives slowly; in Ireland "
"the dark comes early and the windows light up. In between, the same star — "
"and the same wish to be close to the people who matter."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:79
msgid ""
"No Brasil, a luz fica até tarde e a noite chega devagar; na Irlanda, "
"escurece cedo e são as janelas que acendem. Entre os dois, a mesma estrela — "
"e a mesma vontade de estar perto de quem importa."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:96
msgid "Explore both skies"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:96
msgid "Explorar os dois céus"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:97
msgid "See the Christmas calendar"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:97
msgid "Ver a agenda de Natal"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:102
msgid ""
"One lit Christmas star above a summer beach in Brazil, on the left, and a "
"snow-covered Irish village with warm windows and a castle on a hill, on the "
"right."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:103
msgid ""
"Uma estrela de Natal acesa sobre uma praia de verão no Brasil, à esquerda, e "
"uma vila irlandesa coberta de neve, com janelas iluminadas e um castelo no "
"alto, à direita."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:105
msgid "Christmas · Brazil and Ireland"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:105
msgid "Natal · Brasil e Irlanda"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/hero.php:109
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/new_year/hero.php:70
msgid "Close"
msgstr ""
#. translators: preview-only trigger label.
