msgid "Abrir a pré-visualização do boas-vindas"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:40
msgid "Two skies, one star"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:40
msgid "Dois céus, uma mesma estrela"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:42
msgid ""
"The same star appears on both sides of the Atlantic. Choose a sky to light "
"up, and notice what changes — and what stays the same."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:43
msgid ""
"A mesma estrela aparece dos dois lados do Atlântico. Escolha um céu para "
"acender e repare no que muda — e no que continua igual."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:53
msgid "Brazil"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:54
msgid "summer"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:55
msgid "Summer, and the night takes its time"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:56
msgid ""
"December in Brazil is summer. The sun is slow to go down, the street stays "
"busy, and the meal can happen on a balcony, in a back garden or on the "
"pavement — fan on, ice in everything, somebody complaining about the heat."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:58
msgid ""
"Daylight becomes part of the decoration: the evening starts in the light."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:59
msgid "The table usually spills out of the house."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:60
msgid "People drop by after midnight — and stay."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:62
msgid ""
"This is one picture among many. Brazil is huge, and every household keeps "
"Christmas its own way."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:65
msgid "Ireland"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:66
msgid "winter"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:67
msgid "Winter, and the windows do the lighting"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:68
msgid ""
"December in Ireland is winter. The dark arrives in the middle of the "
"afternoon, and that is when the light inside becomes a signal: a lit window, "
"a fire, lights in the garden, a candle on the table."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:70
msgid "The dark comes early, and it makes the light at home count for more."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:71
msgid "The cold gathers everyone into the same room."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:72
msgid "A walk at dusk, just to see the lights on your own street."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:74
msgid ""
"Not a rule either: some people spend Christmas far from family, some work "
"that day, and some do not celebrate it at all."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:77
msgid ""
"What crosses both skies is not the weather. It is the gesture: someone "
"thinks of you, and does something about it."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:78
msgid ""
"Illustration: the same star over a Brazilian summer evening and an Irish "
"winter night."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:79
msgid "Choose a sky"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:80
msgid ""
"A large Christmas star at the centre, with arcs of light reaching a "
"Brazilian beach and city on the left and a snowy Irish hillside with a stone "
"tower on the right."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:84
msgid "Brasil"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:85
msgid "verão"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:86
msgid "Verão, e a noite custa a chegar"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:87
msgid ""
"Dezembro no Brasil é verão. O sol demora a cair, a rua continua cheia e a "
"ceia pode acontecer na varanda, no quintal ou na calçada — ventilador "
"ligado, gelo em tudo, alguém reclamando do calor."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:89
msgid "A luz do dia entra na decoração: a noite começa claro."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:90
msgid "A mesa costuma se espalhar para fora de casa."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:91
msgid "As visitas chegam depois da meia-noite — e ficam."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:93
msgid ""
"Isto é um retrato entre muitos. O Brasil é grande, e cada casa guarda o seu "
"jeito de fazer Natal."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:97
msgid "inverno"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:98
msgid "Inverno, e são as janelas que acendem"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:99
msgid ""
"Dezembro na Irlanda é inverno. Escurece no meio da tarde, e é aí que a luz "
"de dentro vira sinal: janela acesa, lareira, luzinhas no jardim, uma vela na "
"mesa."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:101
msgid "A escuridão chega cedo, e faz a luz de casa valer mais."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:102
msgid "O frio junta todo mundo no mesmo cômodo."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:103
msgid "Um passeio no fim da tarde só para ver as luzes da sua rua."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:105
msgid ""
"Também não é regra: há quem passe o Natal longe da família, quem trabalhe "
"nesse dia e quem não comemore."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:108
msgid ""
"O que atravessa os dois céus não é o clima. É o gesto: alguém pensa em você "
"e faz alguma coisa a respeito."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:109
msgid ""
"Ilustração: a mesma estrela sobre um fim de tarde de verão no Brasil e uma "
"noite de inverno na Irlanda."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:110
msgid "Escolha um céu"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:111
msgid ""
"Uma grande estrela de Natal no centro, com arcos de luz que chegam a uma "
"praia e a uma cidade brasileiras à esquerda e a uma encosta irlandesa "
"coberta de neve, com uma torre de pedra, à direita."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:118
msgid "The journey"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/journey.php:118
msgid "A viagem"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/landing.php:41
msgid "What crosses both skies"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/landing.php:42
msgid ""
"It is not the weather, not the time of day and not the same food. It is "
"something else."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/landing.php:45
msgid "The table"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/landing.php:46
msgid "Eating together changes the day — in the heat or in the cold."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/landing.php:49
msgid "The visit"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/landing.php:50
msgid "Turning up, staying longer than agreed, hearing the same story again."
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/landing.php:53
msgid "The reminder"
msgstr ""
#: wp-content/themes/conexao-br-irlanda/template-parts/commemorative/christmas/landing.php:54
msgid "A card, a message, a dish that travels across the city."
msgstr ""
